# Project Statement – AI Enhanced Smart Task Manager

## 📌 Problem Statement
Modern students and professionals struggle to organize tasks efficiently.  
Most existing productivity apps are either overly complicated or lack intelligent task prioritization.  
There is a need for a simple, fast, and smart task management tool that helps users stay productive.

## 🎯 Scope of the Project
The system includes:
- User authentication
- Task creation, editing, deletion
- AI-based priority scoring
- Reminders and notifications
- Dashboard with analytics
- Cloud-based secure storage

## 👥 Target Users
- Students
- Working professionals
- Freelancers
- Anyone needing structured task organization

## 🔧 High-Level Features
- Task CRUD operations
- AI-based priority engine
- User login system with JWT
- Reminder system
- Analytics dashboard
- Optimized MERN architecture
